nfrastructure changes\r\n[ ] Other... Please describe:\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What is the current behavior?\r\n\r\nEarly `ɵld` is used to generate code for hostBindings, It was changed to `ɵd` in core package but the compiler hasn't caught up yet. \r\n\r\nIssue Number: #24013\r\n\r\n## What is the new behavior?\r\n\r\nThis should update compiler code to use `ɵd`.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\n```\r\n[ ] Yes\r\n[x] No\r\n```\r\n\r\nFix #24013","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/24087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/24087/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/391503645","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/24013#issuecomment-391503645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/24013","id":391503645,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM5MTUwMzY0NQ==","user":{"login":"alexzuza","id":4223314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjMzMTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4223314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza","html_url":"https://github.com/alexzuza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexzuza/received_events","